      "id": 227365,
      "name": "KateWalker",
      "username": "TakeWalker",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/{size}/5677_2.png",
      "created_at": "2019-05-07T18:16:45.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>It was great listening to C&amp;A geek out over comics. :D I'm definitely not of the \"comic book world\" they spoke of. Much as I love superheroes, the characters of comic books have always been cartoons and movies to me.</p>\n<p>The Metaverse fans may not have liked it, but I totally want a Powered Wraith promo.</p>\n<p>You want unhinged? Citizen Hammer x Miss Information 4eva</p>\n<p>And I'm not sure what idea I like more: Old, Clint Eastwood-style Chrono-Ranger, or zero temporal shenanigans and what I'm going to term \"La Cougadora\". :V</p>",
      "post_number": 5,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T06:01:32.943Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
