      "read": false,
      "user_title": "",
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>It was great listening to C&amp;A geek out over comics. :D I'm definitely not of the \"comic book world\" they spoke of. Much as I love superheroes, the characters of comic books have always been cartoons and movies to me.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The Metaverse fans may not have liked it, but I totally want a Powered Wraith promo.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>You want unhinged? Citizen Hammer x Miss Information 4eva</p>\r\n\r\n<p>And I'm not sure what idea I like more: Old, Clint Eastwood-style Chrono-Ranger, or zero temporal shenanigans and what I'm going to term \"La Cougadora\". :V</p>",
