      "cooked": "<p>I don’t know who I’d want writing OblivAeon...but for a Daybreak comic, I’m torn between Greg Weisman (just finished rewatching Young Justice season 2 last night) and Ryan North (because his work on Squirrel Girl is absolutely phenomenal. Honestly I don’t read that many superhero comics right now, but I would recommend that one to anyone). Those would be totally different versions of the team, but either one would be so much fun.</p>",
