      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/l/f4b2a3/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2025-10-22T13:15:40.187Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Was there any previous mention of Sk8Blayd, or are they just joking by implying so?</p>\n<p>The psyche comic might well have been a progenitor idea for Visionary.</p>\n<p>I think we generally don’t talk much about fan expansion stuff, but the Cauldron character The Knight can easily be played as if he was White Knight.  Or Blue Shield. (And White Zombie is Slice from Screamachine.)</p>\n<p>My guest creator team for OblivAeon: Kurt Busiek and Alex Ross.</p>\n<p>Wraith Boy!</p>\n<p>A good way to explain the Telenovelaverse is “needs no further development”.  You know everything you need to know about it already.</p>",
